		<properties node_id="0" format="literal">{'controlAreaVisible': True, 'llm_col_name': 'acronym analysis', 'llm_summary_name': 'acronym', 'ollama_url': 'http://localhost:11434', 'output_mode_idx': 1, 'prompt_template': 'You are an expert bioinformatician. Below is an input containing a Functional Unit identifier and a list of gene symbols. These genes encode proteins that perform the exact same biological task in a pathway.\n\nInput:\nGene Symbols: {Gene Symbols}\n\nTask: \n1. Briefly identify the shared biological function or protein family of these genes.\n2. Propose a single, generic acronym (2 to 6 capital letters) representing this group.\n3. At the absolute end of your response, on a new line, write strictly the proposed symbol. \n\nCrucial Rule for Step 3:\nThe very last line of your response must contain ONLY the symbol. Do not add a period or any other text.\n\nResponse:', 'query_auto': False, 'savedWidgetGeometry': b'\x01\xd9\xd0\xcb\x00\x03\x00\x00\x00\x00\x02B\x00\x00\x01"\x00\x00\x05&gt;\x00\x00\x03\x15\x00\x00\x02B\x00\x00\x01"\x00\x00\x05&gt;\x00\x00\x03\x15\x00\x00\x00\x01\x00\x00\x00\x00\x07\x80\x00\x00\x02B\x00\x00\x01"\x00\x00\x05&gt;\x00\x00\x03\x15', 'selected_model': 'phi4-mini:latest', 'split_last_line': True, '__version__': 1}</properties>
